C03: the reviewed turn accepts a verified app.open before the reviewed click (UI1395)

UI1393 measured «abrí la calculadora y apretá el 5»: the mind planned app.open + input.visible.click, the Calculator opened (completed, verified, real process) and the App asked to confirm the click, but the reviewed turn was rejected as review_pending_not_supported because MainWindowViewModel.ConductorConfirmationShape only admits a single-step plan or a verified read prefix (web.search before browser.navigate, window.resolve/window.active before app.close); the shell trace names the refusal «shape».

MainWindowViewModel.ConductorConfirmationShape: a two-step plan whose first step is a completed, verified app.open with a positive processId, and whose current step is input.visible.click with the single label argument, is a capturable confirmation. The reviewer still sees only the label; nothing else changes.

App recompiled (BUILD1395). Tests not run (owner order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


